openfga

This plugin was ported from the OpenFGA agent-skills project and adapted for
Claude Code (added .claude-plugin/plugin.json, package.json, and Claude-compatible
SKILL.md frontmatter). The upstream skill content is licensed under Apache-2.0.

Upstream source:
  openfga/agent-skills — skills/openfga
  https://github.com/openfga/agent-skills/tree/main/skills/openfga

Files ported/adapted from this source:
  skills/openfga/SKILL.md          (frontmatter adapted to Claude Code shape)
  skills/openfga/references/*.md   (ported verbatim, 37 files)

The upstream AGENTS.md compiled document and scripts/ build tooling were not
ported; this plugin relies on SKILL.md plus the references/ tree directly.

